{"seq":2,"slug":"promotion-cart-preview","title":"可用优惠推荐与最优券预览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shopping-cart-service-engineering/price-realtime/promotion-cart-preview","wordCount":3142,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"可用优惠推荐与最优券预览\">可用优惠推荐与最优券预览</h1><p>购物车页上最容易被低估的一块计算是「这单能用哪张券」。它看起来只是遍历用户持有的优惠券，实际却是一个带资源约束的组合枚举问题：券之间有互斥与叠加关系、有门槛条件依赖整车金额、有些券还限定了适用商品范围。用户手里十张券、车里二十件商品，朴素枚举的组合数会迅速变成天文数字。</p>\n<p>本篇讲的是这层计算的工程实现：如何建模券之间的关系、如何在可接受的枚举规模内找到「实付最低」的那一组、以及为什么向用户展示的必须是「最优解」而不是「第一组可行解」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-券的三种关系与两类门槛\">核心概念：券的三种关系与两类门槛</h2><p>先定义术语，避免后面混淆。<strong>券</strong>（coupon）是可被用户持有、可主动选择使用的优惠凭据；<strong>促销</strong>（promotion）是系统自动生效的规则，不需要用户选择。两者在计算上共享同一套「参与条件 + 折扣效果」模型，区别只在触发方式。本篇讨论的择优问题同时覆盖两者，因为用户看到的是「最终金额」，他并不关心哪部分是自动的。</p>\n<p>券之间的关系只有三种，任何促销引擎都必须能表达它们：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>计算影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>互斥</td>\n<td>不可同时使用</td>\n<td>平台券与店铺券二选一</td>\n<td>需要枚举分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叠加</td>\n<td>可同时使用</td>\n<td>平台券 + 单品直降</td>\n<td>可合并计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖</td>\n<td>一张的生效以前一张为前提</td>\n<td>满减券 + 支付立减</td>\n<td>有确定的求值顺序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>依赖关系是唯一带来顺序问题的关系</strong>。若 A 是「满 300 减 50」，B 是「支付立减 10%」，那么 A 必须先算（因为 B 作用在 A 之后的金额上），且反过来算会得到不同的结果。求值顺序不能靠猜测，必须由图中的依赖边显式决定，并在存在环时拒绝加载该规则集（环意味着一组规则无法有确定结果，是配置错误而非运行时问题）。</p>\n<p><strong>两类门槛</strong>决定了券能否参与：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>金额门槛</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i \\in S} p_i \\ge \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是适用商品集合。注意这里用的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 而不是整车，因为券常常限定品类。</li>\n<li><strong>件数门槛</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i \\in S} q_i \\ge m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>。它不能用金额替代——「3 件 8 折」在客单价差异大的购物车里与任何金额阈值都不等价。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>用金额门槛做例子：设券 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的折扣为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，适用集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则使用该券后的实付金额为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(S_c) = \\sum_{i \\in S_c} p_i - d_c \\left( \\sum_{i \\in S_c} p_i \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4444em;vertical-align:-1.3944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1444em;vertical-align:-1.3944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对固定折扣率的情形，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_c(x) = r_c \\cdot x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>；对满减券，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_c(x) = f_c \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[x \\ge \\theta_c]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"择优是组合优化-为什么贪心会错\">择优是组合优化：为什么贪心会错</h2><p>一个自然的想法是贪心：按折扣金额从大到小排序，依次尝试加入，冲突就跳过。这个策略在多数情况下给出不错的结果，但它<strong>不保证最优</strong>，而且在门槛型券上的失效方式很反直觉。</p>\n<p>考虑一个具体的反例。车里三件商品：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1 = 200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2 = 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_3 = 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>，总计 350。用户持有两张券：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>券 A：满 300 减 80，全品类适用。</li>\n<li>券 B：品类券，仅对商品 3 适用，满 50 减 30。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>贪心按折扣金额排序会先选 A（省 80），得到 270。此时 B 的适用集合只有商品 3（50 元），满足门槛，且 A 与 B 不互斥，所以最优是 A + B，实付 240。这个例子里贪心恰好没出错，因为它没在第一时间排除 B。</p>\n<p>换成另一个组合：券 A 满 300 减 100（全品类），券 B 满 200 减 90（全品类），A 与 B 互斥。整车 350。选 A 得 250，选 B 得 260，最优是 A。贪心也对。</p>\n<p>真正让贪心失效的是<strong>门槛被跨过或跌破</strong>的情形。若券 A 满 300 减 100 与券 C「仅商品 1、满 250 减 80」互斥，而车里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>260</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1 = 260</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">260</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2 = 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span>。选 A 需要整车 320 满足门槛，实付 220；选 C 只用商品 1 的 260 满足门槛，实付 240。贪心按面额选 A 得 220，仍然最优。</p>\n<p>构造失败的贪心需要更细的结构：当「选择某张券会缩小后续券的适用集合、从而让后续高折扣券失去门槛」时，局部最优会引导到全局次优。这类结构在真实促销里确实存在，尤其是在「品类券 + 平台券 + 单品券」三层叠加且互斥关系跨层配置时。</p>\n<p>结论是：<strong>贝叶斯意义上的好算法不是贪心，而是带剪枝的搜索</strong>。贪心的合理用途是作为剪枝的上界估计，而不是最终答案。这种「用上界估计剪掉不可能更优的分支」的范式就是组合优化里的分支定界（branch and bound）；它把最坏情况仍是指数级，但在有有效界时能剪掉绝大部分搜索空间（来源：Branch and bound, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Branch_and_bound\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Branch_and_bound</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"剪枝搜索-把指数压回可用区间\">剪枝搜索：把指数压回可用区间</h2><p>朴素枚举是「券集合的幂集」，规模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。用户持有 10 张券就是 1024 种组合，20 张就是一百万——前者可接受，后者不可接受。真正的剪枝来自三个观察。</p>\n<p><strong>观察一：互斥把幂集切成若干独立子问题。</strong> 若券被划分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个互斥组，每组内最多选一张，则组合数是各组选项数的乘积而不是幂集大小：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_{g=1}^{k} (|G_g| + 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.2393em;vertical-align:-1.4032em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4032em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若有 4 组、每组 3 张券，组合数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^4 = 256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span>，远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4096</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{12} = 4096</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span></span></span></span></span>。这是最有价值的一次剪枝，且它的收益随券数增多而放大——因为互斥关系通常呈现「分层」结构（平台层 / 店铺层 / 单品层），组数增长慢于券数增长。</p>\n<p><strong>观察二：门槛给出可行性的必要性剪枝。</strong> 对任一候选组合，先算参与商品的金额和件数，不满足门槛的直接丢弃，不进入折扣计算。更有效的是「上界剪枝」：若当前部分组合的最大可能折扣已经不超过已知最优解，则整枝剪掉。最大可能折扣可以宽松估计为「剩余未选券的面额之和」，这个上界计算很便宜。</p>\n<p><strong>观察三：适用集合的包含关系给出支配剪枝。</strong> 若券 A 的适用集合是券 B 的适用集合的子集，且 A 的折扣在任意金额上都不超过 B，则 A 被 B 支配，可以从候选中移除。这条规则能消掉大量运营为了不同人群配的重复券。</p>\n<p>三者叠加后的实际复杂度远低于理论最坏值。整个搜索的执行形状如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[输入: 行集合 + 用户券 + 规则集] --&gt; B[按互斥组划分候选空间]&#10;    B --&gt; C[生成组间组合笛卡尔积]&#10;    C --&gt; D{剩余组合为空?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[输出当前最优]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[取一组候选]&#10;    F --&gt; G{门槛满足?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| H[丢弃该组合]&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I{折扣上界 &lt;= 已知最优?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| H&#10;    I --&gt;|否| J[计算实际折扣并更新最优]&#10;    H --&gt; K{超过时间预算?}&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt;|是| L[回退贪心近似解, 标记 approximate]&#10;    K --&gt;|否| D\">flowchart TD\n    A[输入: 行集合 + 用户券 + 规则集] --&gt; B[按互斥组划分候选空间]\n    B --&gt; C[生成组间组合笛卡尔积]\n    C --&gt; D{剩余组合为空?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[输出当前最优]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[取一组候选]\n    F --&gt; G{门槛满足?}\n    G --&gt;|否| H[丢弃该组合]\n    G --&gt;|是| I{折扣上界 &lt;= 已知最优?}\n    I --&gt;|是| H\n    I --&gt;|否| J[计算实际折扣并更新最优]\n    H --&gt; K{超过时间预算?}\n    J --&gt; K\n    K --&gt;|是| L[回退贪心近似解, 标记 approximate]\n    K --&gt;|否| D</pre><p>工程上还需要一个<strong>硬性时间预算</strong>：无论剪枝多好，都要设定一个搜索上限（例如 50ms 或探索节点数 10 万），超限则回退到「贪心 + 一次局部交换」的近似解，并在响应里标记 <code>approximate</code>。购物车页不能因为一次券计算而卡住——把最坏情况封顶，是这条管线的必要设计。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>剪枝手段</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n<th>典型收益</th>\n<th>是否总是可用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>互斥分组</td>\n<td>规则声明</td>\n<td>高（指数降为乘积）</td>\n<td>是，需规则显式声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门槛必要性</td>\n<td>金额/件数条件</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折扣上界</td>\n<td>剩余券面额之和</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是，上界宽松</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合支配</td>\n<td>适用集合包含 + 折扣偏序</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需要静态分析规则集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间预算兜底</td>\n<td>硬截止</td>\n<td>保证尾延迟</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"展示语义-最优解-次优提示与凑单引导\">展示语义：最优解、次优提示与凑单引导</h2><p>算出最优解之后，还有一层纯产品与工程的交互问题：<strong>展示什么</strong>。</p>\n<p>多数平台展示两种信息：当前选择的券与其实付金额（默认给最优组合），以及「再买 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 元可享 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 优惠」的凑单提示。后者的计算比前者简单得多——它是「给定当前选择，找到最小的额外面向某张券的门槛差距」。对每张未使用的、适用集合可扩大的券 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，差额为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><mtext>候选</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_c = \\max\\left(0,\\ \\theta_c - \\sum_{i \\in S_c \\cup \\text{候选}} p_i\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1444em;vertical-align:-1.3944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∪</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">候选</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把这些差额排序取最小几个，就是凑单提示。注意「候选」里可以放什么需要约束：通常只从当前可售、同品类、且价格接近差额的商品里选，否则会推荐一件比差额还贵的商品，得不偿失。推荐位本身属于 <code>../../19_product-recommendation-engineering/</code> 的范围，本 hub 只负责产生这个「差额」信号。</p>\n<p>关于次优提示，有一个必须明确的边界：<strong>不要在购物车里展示「另一组更贵但包含更多商品」的方案</strong>。购物车的任务是让用户对当前选择有信心，引入方案对比会把决策成本转嫁给用户，实测通常降低转化。</p>\n<p>还有一个容易被忽略的正确性问题：<strong>最优解必须在可售行集合上计算</strong>。若某行已失效但仍被计入门槛，用户会看到一张其实无法使用的券被推荐。可售性的判定属于第三章，购物车的券计算应当只接收「已通过校验的行」——因此正确顺序是先校验再算券，或者算券时把失效行的金额从门槛计算中排除。这个顺序问题详见 <a href=\"../inventory-validation/available-check\">加购/查看时库存预校验（不预占）</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性与缓存-券版本与用户券状态\">一致性与缓存：券版本与用户券状态</h2><p>券计算有两侧输入，各自有独立的一致性问题。</p>\n<p><strong>规则侧</strong>：券的规则集由促销中台维护，会随时变更（运营在大促当天改门槛并不罕见）。购物车必须缓存规则集以避免每次请求都拉取，缓存键应包含<strong>规则集版本号</strong>，并在响应里回显版本号，便于事后归因「这单当时是按哪一版规则算的」。这一条与上一篇促销缓存的处理一致。</p>\n<p><strong>用户侧</strong>：用户持有的券及其使用状态（已用/已过期/已锁定）属于账户维度，变化频繁。这里最关键的是<strong>锁定语义</strong>：从购物车展示最优券到用户提交订单之间存在时间窗，若在这段时间内该券在另一台设备上被用掉了，下单就会失败。主流做法是在下单预占阶段对选中的券做<strong>短时锁定</strong>（例如 10 分钟），锁定失败则返回「券已不可用」并触发一次重算。锁定属于下单侧，边界与实现见 <a href=\"../inventory-validation/cart-hold-separation\">购物车校验与下单预占的边界</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>不要在购物车阶段锁定券</strong>。购物车是高频读路径，用户可能一天打开十次而不下单；每次打开都锁券会让券资源被大量虚占，其他用户无法使用。把锁定推迟到预占阶段，是资源效率与体验的正确平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>券之间只有互斥、叠加、依赖三种关系；依赖关系决定求值顺序，规则集含环时应拒绝加载而不是运行时兜底。</li>\n<li>门槛分金额与件数两类，件数门槛不能用金额替代。</li>\n<li>择优是组合优化，贪心不保证最优；贪心的正确用途是提供上界以辅助剪枝。</li>\n<li>剪枝四件套：互斥分组（指数降为乘积）、门槛必要性、折扣上界、集合支配；再加硬时间预算兜底，超限回退近似解并标记。</li>\n<li>凑单提示只需算「到门槛的差额」，简单且有效；不要在购物车展示多方案对比。</li>\n<li>最优解必须在可售行集合上计算；先校验再算券，或算券时排除失效行。</li>\n<li>规则侧缓存带版本号并回显；用户侧券在购物车不锁定，锁定推迟到下单预占阶段。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>券算完之后，价格变化本身也需要被用户感知——降价、失效、券将过期如何变成实时提示，是下一篇的主题，见 <a href=\"price-change-signal\">降价/失效实时提示与推送</a>。整车金额明细最终会进入下单快照，见 <a href=\"../storage-checkout/cart-to-order-snapshot\">购物车到下单的快照与防篡改</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可用优惠推荐与最优券预览","id":"可用优惠推荐与最优券预览"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：券的三种关系与两类门槛","id":"核心概念-券的三种关系与两类门槛"},{"level":2,"text":"择优是组合优化：为什么贪心会错","id":"择优是组合优化-为什么贪心会错"},{"level":2,"text":"剪枝搜索：把指数压回可用区间","id":"剪枝搜索-把指数压回可用区间"},{"level":2,"text":"展示语义：最优解、次优提示与凑单引导","id":"展示语义-最优解-次优提示与凑单引导"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性与缓存：券版本与用户券状态","id":"一致性与缓存-券版本与用户券状态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"打开购物车实时重算价格管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shopping-cart-service-engineering/price-realtime/cart-repricing"},"next":{"title":"降价/失效实时提示与推送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shopping-cart-service-engineering/price-realtime/price-change-signal"}}